{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24049","headline":"咏所乐 · 白居易","name":"咏所乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兽乐在山谷，鱼乐在陂池。\n虫乐在深草，鸟乐在高枝。\n所乐虽不同，同归适其宜。\n不以彼易此，况论是与非。\n而我何所乐，所乐在分司。\n分司有何乐，乐哉人不知。\n官优有禄料，职散无羁縻。\n嬾与道相近，钝将闲自随。\n昨朝拜表回，今晚行香归。\n归来北窗下，解巾脱尘衣。\n冷泉灌我顶，暖水濯四肢。\n体中幸无疾，卧任清风吹。\n心中又无事，坐任白日移。\n或开书一篇，或引酒一巵。\n但得如今日，终身无厌时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}